    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15227" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμά̆τ-ειος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to
				a chariot,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύριγγες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					230
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					6.4.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ant.Lib.
				11.3
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμάτιον</span> codd.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμάτινον,</span> Apoll.<u>Lex.</u>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίφρον</span>
			, is prob. corrupt; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					2.20.1
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόυος ἁ.</span> name of a
				<i>melody for the flute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.335a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1133e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ. μέλος,</span> stage-direction
			in <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				[1384]
			</span></i>.</div>
